{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29672","headline":"梓州罢吟寄同舍 · 李商隐","name":"梓州罢吟寄同舍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不拣花朝与雪朝，五年从事霍嫖姚。\n君缘接座交珠履，我爲分行近翠翘。\n楚雨含情皆有托，漳滨卧病竟无憀。\n长吟远下燕台去，惟有衣香染未销。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29672.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29672","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}